{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/2_\u041c\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0436\u043d\u0430\u044f_\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c_1.png?t=1745134737\" /><br><strong>&quot;Alive&quot; is a PointAndClick type adventure in a Slavic setting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character is Vi, a 16 year old girl in search of adventure. For some reason, she ends up locked in a strange village, where she immediately revives a corpse, makes friends with a local crazy old man and gets a witch into trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Vi be able to resolve all the troubles and return home? How did Anya die? Why was the leshiy angry at Vi? What do witches really do?<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/photo_2024-11-03_22-25-28.jpg?t=1745134737\" /><br><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep plot with multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slavic mythology in an original interpretation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles with multiple solutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unusual characters and dark humor<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/logo.gif?t=1745134737\" /><br><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mystical world, collect items, solve puzzles and uncover the secrets of the mysterious village. Communicate with unusual characters, make decisions that affect the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/\u0443-\u043a\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430__1_.gif?t=1745134737\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625280?t=1745134737","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/6c3b81a8bd8e9fee01056d2c4f66875f705015eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745134737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/c312d904240745f495fed461a2e1ac6473691ff4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745134737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/c312d904240745f495fed461a2e1ac6473691ff4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745134737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3636330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/2_\u041c\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0436\u043d\u0430\u044f_\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c_1.png?t=1745134737\" /><br><strong>&quot;Alive&quot; is a PointAndClick type adventure in a Slavic setting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character is Vi, a 16 year old girl in search of adventure. For some reason, she ends up locked in a strange village, where she immediately revives a corpse, makes friends with a local crazy old man and gets a witch into trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Vi be able to resolve all the troubles and return home? How did Anya die? Why was the leshiy angry at Vi? What do witches really do?<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/photo_2024-11-03_22-25-28.jpg?t=1745134737\" /><br><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep plot with multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slavic mythology in an original interpretation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles with multiple solutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unusual charact